{"id":"f0380129bd9e48f3","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-gl-decidable.md","title":"GL Decidable Theorem","display":"thm-gl-decidable — GL Decidable Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-gl-decidable","aliases":["89-thm-gl-decidable"],"display":"thm-gl-decidable — GL Decidable Theorem","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-decidability]]","[[89-thm-fmp-gl]]","[[89-df-gl-algorithm]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]","[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-gl-decidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-gl-decidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gl-decidable — GL Decidable Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"128a3cd6545693f6\" href=\"?note=128a3cd6545693f6\" title=\"89-df-gl-decidability\">89-df-gl-decidability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f4b51513503cf1c0\" href=\"?note=f4b51513503cf1c0\" title=\"89-thm-fmp-gl\">89-thm-fmp-gl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3bbdf6f3419b5805\" href=\"?note=3bbdf6f3419b5805\" title=\"89-df-gl-algorithm\">89-df-gl-algorithm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" href=\"?note=b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" title=\"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel\">89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0157f8bea9275cf1\" href=\"?note=0157f8bea9275cf1\" title=\"89-thm-gl-soundness\">89-thm-gl-soundness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{\\mathrm{GL}}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(d_{\\mathrm{GL}}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> is the bounded finite-model procedure.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\,\n\\bigl(d_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)=1\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\,\n\\bigl(d_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)=1\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 5 章，印刷页 78–84；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n有界候选模型可有限枚举。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 属 GL，可靠性排除每个候选反模型，算法输出 1；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 不属 GL，有界反模型引理给出至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}(A)|}\">\\(2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}(A)|}\\)</span> 个世界的反模型，重编号后在候选集中，算法输出 0。因此不是仅凭未带有效界的 FMP 直接断言某个固定界算法正确。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-decidability","status":"resolved","id":"128a3cd6545693f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-decidability]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-fmp-gl","status":"resolved","id":"f4b51513503cf1c0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-fmp-gl]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-algorithm","status":"resolved","id":"3bbdf6f3419b5805","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-algorithm]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel","status":"resolved","id":"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gl-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0157f8bea9275cf1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"d_{\\mathrm{GL}}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\,\n\\bigl(d_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)=1\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}(A)|}","display":false}],"bytes":1261,"backlinks":[{"id":"c1e4657a556ae258","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接依赖给出同一特征函数等价式的 [[89-thm-gl-decidable]]，而不是\n只断言抽象可判定性谓词的同名定理。"},{"id":"4ba460c900107e00","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1b619488086561ea","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-decidable]] 给出总的特征函数 $d_{\\mathrm{GL}}$；据\n[[89-df-gl-decidability]] 取专用模态编码。对任意自然数 $n$，先计算 $\\mathrm{dec}_{\\Box}(n)$；非法码输出 0，合法码 $A$ 输出 $d_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A)$。两个程序都终止，且 [[89-lem-gl-proof-closure]] 证明 $\\mathcal{T\\!h}_{G\\!L}=\\mathrm{GL}$，所以这个全域程序恰是定理码集的特征函数。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]] → [[89-df-gl-algorithm]] → [[89-thm-gl-decidable]] → [[89-thm-gl-tree-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["128a3cd6545693f6","f4b51513503cf1c0","3bbdf6f3419b5805","0006800fa1c85177","b47f1c6b1cd23b5e","0157f8bea9275cf1"]}